    contains homogeneous nondivisors of zero. Since it contains some nondivisors
    of #source(
      101,
    )zero, then in the notation of the solution of
    Problem~@pr:projective-rational-function-domain $I_f subset.not I_s$ for any
    $s$. Therefore, for any $s$ there exists a homogeneous element $q_s in I_f$
    such that $q_s in.not I_s$. We may assume (see the solution of
    Problem~@pr:projective-rational-function-domain) that the degrees of all
